|lore=Security officer from Kiffex searching for the Tonnika sisters. In love with one of them, he's not sure which.
|game_text=Adds 2 to power of anything he pilots. Twice during battle at same system, may use 2 Force to add 2 to any destiny of 2. If present with Tonnika Sisters, Vul and Tonnika Sisters are lost.
|joke=Vul Tazaene is in love with one of the [[Tonnika Sisters]], who are twins, but "he's not sure which." [[Lando Calrissian (Dark)|Lando Calrissian]] makes the same joke. See [[Jokes#Vul_Tazaene|Jokes]].
